<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to EduCRM</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        }
        .content {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background-color: #4CAF50;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #777;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Welcome to EduCRM!</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
        <p>Hello {{name}},</p>

        <p>Welcome to EduCRM, your comprehensive educational management platform. We're excited to have you on board!</p>

        <p>Your account has been successfully created with the following details:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Email:</strong> {{email}}</li>
            <li><strong>Role:</strong> {{role}}</li>
            <li><strong>Institution:</strong> {{institution}}</li>
        </ul>

        <p>To get started, please click the button below to set up your password and access your account:</p>

        <a href="{{activationLink}}" class="button">Activate Your Account</a>

        <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, please don't hesitate to contact our support team.</p>

        <p>Best regards,<br>The EduCRM Team</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>&copy; 2025 EduCRM. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>This email was sent to {{email}}. If you did not request this, please ignore this email.</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
